# score: Prelude in C major, BWV 846 (J. S. Bach), bars 1-4
# summary: 4 bars / 1 piano, 3 staves and the sustain pedal / ~0.27 min — the Ariadne piano's demo
# tempo: 72    time: 4/4    key: C    bars: 4
# master: rms=-24

# text @b1: each half bar: the bass held, the tenor entering a sixteenth later and held, the right hand's figure twice
# text @b1: the pedal changes with each bar's harmony, a moment after the downbeat (syncopated pedalling)
# text @b4: the last chord is held three beats past the bar and let go with the pedal

# instruments:
#   pn   = grand piano (treble, anatomy=piano-v1)
#   pn.l = left hand, bass (bass)
#   pn.t = left hand, tenor (bass)
#   pn.r = right hand (treble)
#   pn.ped = sustain pedal (perc, pedal=sustain)

